\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.2}{\ignorespaces How ProSiT discovers and runs a simulation model. The alignment replays every recorded case on the net, so that each decision, also at silent transitions, becomes a training example. One probabilistic decision tree is learned per component, and the simulator executes the net with these trees.}}{20}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:bg_prosit_pipeline}{{2.2}{20}{How ProSiT discovers and runs a simulation model. The alignment replays every recorded case on the net, so that each decision, also at silent transitions, becomes a training example. One probabilistic decision tree is learned per component, and the simulator executes the net with these trees}{figure.caption.12}{}}
\citation{Vinci2026prosit}
